      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "and a large crowd of people had gathered under the Town Hall clock.",
      "translation": "一大群人聚集在市政厅的大钟下面。",
      "startTime": 21.86,
      "endTime": 27.31,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "It would strike twelve in twenty minutes' time.",
      "translation": "再过20分钟，大钟将敲响12下。",
      "startTime": 27.32,
      "endTime": 31.51,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
